 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Um, hello. It's my tonsils again, they seem to be infected. I'm sorry to bother you."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "You're not bothering me at all. Tell me how it started."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A sore throat, about four days ago. Now it's hard to swallow."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Is it on one side or both?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Both, but the left is worse."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Have you had a fever, or white spots on the tonsils?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I felt hot and shivery two nights ago. I didn't look at my tonsils, I'm too nervous."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any rash, or trouble breathing?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No rash. No trouble breathing."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How many times have you had tonsillitis this year?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "This is the fourth time. Maybe the fifth."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That's a lot. What are you taking now?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Paracetamol, 1 gram, four times a day. And lozenges, whenever I remember."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any other tablets?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Just the pill, the contraceptive."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you smoke?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. Never."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me take your temperature and pulse. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Of course.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Temperature 37.9, pulse 92."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that high? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A mild fever. Now open your mouth for me, and say ah. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ahh.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Both tonsils are red and swollen, with white patches on the left, and the glands in your neck are tender."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Does that mean it's infected? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yes, it looks like bacterial tonsillitis. I'll prescribe penicillin V, 500 mg, four times a day for ten days."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ten days? I'd rather it was shorter. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Ten days is needed to clear it properly. I know it's a long time. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "All right. I'll do it. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "With four or five episodes in a year, I'd also like to refer you to an ENT surgeon about taking the tonsils out."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Oh. That sounds scary. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's very common, and it often helps people who get infections this often. They'll explain everything. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. Thank you for explaining. ~"
  }
